                    <p class='article__time'>April 14, 2026</p>
                    <h3 class='title'><em>Rural Communities: Worth the Investment</em></h3>
                    <p class="speaker">
                        
                        
                                    
                                    
                                    <a href="/aboutthefed/bios/board/barr.htm">Governor Michael S. Barr</a>
                                    
                                    
                                    
                                    
                        
                    </p> 
                    <p class='location'>At Strengthening America’s Economy through Rural Investment: A Working Forum, Washington, D.C.</p>
